{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617410/extras/Goblomite_alt_title.png?t=1746110728\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An explosive physics-based platformer.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for the challenging dynamite-based movement used as a last resort for your poor little goblin friend to discover the truth of this world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A combination of speed and accuracy.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Goblomite timing is key, using your mouse or joystick aim your dynamite and throw it under your feet to blow yourself up and around obstacles to reach your goal. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An empty world.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself alone in this strange world, it is up to you to explore and understand the complexities of your existence.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedrunning.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go from hours to progress just a small amount, to finishing the game in minutes, use the built-in speedrun mode to measure your time and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617410/extras/speed_gif.gif?t=1746110728\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617410?t=1746110728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617410/67ef8b3c28721ecca39b4d37276c460c48a1786d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746110728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617410/fac1181040a41004bca60dc0689d4d3d09408c56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746110728","capsule_imagev5":"https://share